    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ecto Mercenary Program is a sci-fi looter shooter where you and your friends form a mercenary group to forge a path for yourselves.</strong>\u00a0Rise from a destitute crew fighting raiders for scraps to a feared force on the station. Survival is not guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your group starts extremely poor with barely enough to afford the bare necessities in staying alive. On the way up, you and your friends get to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Contracts.</strong>\u00a0Curry favor with the more powerful factions in the station. Get access to technologies that only they have, and areas they control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade and maintain equipment.</strong> Equipment you have will degrade overtime. Repairing old equipment comes at the risk of permanently degrading them unless materials are provided. Weigh the risks between bringing cheap disposable crap for a mission or more expensive and powerful gear!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ecto Mercenary Program is a sci-fi looter shooter where you and your friends form a mercenary group to forge a path for yourselves.</strong>\u00a0Rise from a destitute crew fighting raiders for scraps to a feared force on the station. Survival is not guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your group starts extremely poor with barely enough to afford the bare necessities in staying alive. On the way up, you and your friends get to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Contracts.</strong>\u00a0Curry favor with the more powerful factions in the station. Get access to technologies that only they have, and areas they control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade and maintain equipment.</strong> Equipment you have will degrade overtime. Repairing old equipment comes at the risk of permanently degrading them unless materials are provided. Weigh the risks between bringing cheap disposable crap for a mission or more expensive and powerful gear!</p></li></ul>",
